        - FilesetMapProtocol -> FilesetMapABC subclass ABC, use @abstractmethod)
        - ConfigTranslatorProtocol -> ConfigTranslatorABC subclass ABC, use @abstractmethod)
    [ ] 'content/config_assembly_system/translation_system/config_dtos.py': Align concrete translation components with ABC contracts
